  "bodyHash": "45267da791a6eb2b",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>轻量级物品栏整理</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">适用于 Fabric 的简单、轻量级物品栏整理器<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flightweight-inventory-sorting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/GTA4awvHfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1076653/description_db6131b4-240f-444c-8677-0ebe8ba9cd35.png\" alt=\"展示容器内物品整理的 GIF\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>仅客户端</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9b7401372909cc8d2c7fd5f2541b0ed397262571.gif\" alt=\"展示容器内物品整理的 GIF\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 按字母/数字顺序整理物品（或倒序）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 将同类物品合并为堆叠</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 支持以下容器：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 箱子（单/双格、矿车、船等）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 末影箱</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 桶</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 潜影盒</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 玩家背包</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可自定义设置（需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 按钮大小与位置调整</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 排序类型</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;未定义</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必需依赖</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可选依赖</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;未定义</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>许可协议</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组遵循&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/borknbeans/LightweightInventorySorting/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>分发</span></p>",
